# Request Flow Diagram (Mermaid)

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Agent] -->|HTTP request| B[Tamias Proxy]
    B --> C{Router Mode}
    C -->|shadow| D[Record decision]
    D --> E[Forward unchanged]
    C -->|active| F[Rewrite to cheap-model]
    F --> G[Fail-closed gate]
    G -->|pass| H[Forward to provider]
    G -->|fail| I[Refuse request]
    C -->|off| J[Forward unchanged]
    J --> H

    style A fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b
    style B fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b
    style C fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17
    style D fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style E fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style F fill:#ffeb3b,stroke:#f57f17
    style G fill:#ffeb3b,stroke:#f57f17
    style H fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#388e3c
    style I fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#c62828
    style J fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#388e3c
```